WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.015
Week 24: Commands, Advice, and Procedures. give a safe procedure offer advice distinguish request from order

2
00:00:08.015 --> 00:00:14.921
Cultural lens. Hierarchy, formality, and mitigation in workplaces and public services.

3
00:00:14.921 --> 00:00:26.993
Avoid the single-story trap. Treat country, region, age, relationship, and setting as variables. Describe the evidence you have without turning one example into a universal rule.

4
00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:38.851
Language variation. Recognize regional choices and ask what a form means locally. Use the neutral course model for production until the situation gives you a reason to adapt.

5
00:00:38.851 --> 00:00:47.850
Reflection. Compare this context with one you know. Name one similarity, one difference, and one question that would prevent an assumption.

6
00:00:47.850 --> 00:01:14.279
Model language. Apague el equipo antes de abrirlo. — Turn off the equipment before opening it. No compartas esa contraseña. — Do not share that password. Asegúrense de guardar una copia. — Make sure you save a copy. Comprobemos los datos otra vez. — Let's check the data again. Conviene evitar este camino de noche. — It is advisable to avoid this road at night.

7
00:01:14.279 --> 00:01:24.198
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
